        "TileImage": "$($repository c480a7ee-33a3-4147-b2f1-fefb2ec8e1a3).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening 47.\rWe have been tasked with the elimination of Corvo Black, the personal fixer of Don Yates.\rWorking under the cover as an investigative consultant, Black performs various crimes for Yates, such as burglaries, murders and tempering with evidence. If we wanna get a hold of Yates, we have to kill Black.\rThe target is considered to be highly dangerous, so be careful.\rEliminate the target, avoiding all collateral damages.\rGood luck 47, I&apos;ll leave you to prepare.\rMission status: ACTIVE",
